1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,450
Every month, you make a small decision for your future.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:09,629
You invest, you plan, and you move a little closer to what matters.

3
00:00:09,629 --> 00:00:12,922
But sometimes, life changes the plan.

4
00:00:12,922 --> 00:00:15,843
Maybe the market feels uncertain.

5
00:00:15,843 --> 00:00:18,691
Maybe an expense cannot wait.

6
00:00:18,691 --> 00:00:21,372
Or maybe your goal has changed.

7
00:00:21,372 --> 00:00:23,355
Different reasons.

8
00:00:23,355 --> 00:00:25,675
One important decision.

9
00:00:25,675 --> 00:00:29,016
Your investing app helps you manage your SIP.

10
00:00:29,016 --> 00:00:35,350
Before you confirm a change, you may want to understand what it means for the contributions you planned.

11
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:38,090
That is where Skip Check comes in.

12
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:43,283
Skip Check is a separate decision-support experience from FinLit Ventures.

13
00:00:43,283 --> 00:00:48,944
It helps you see the contribution difference before you finish the action in your own app.

14
00:00:48,944 --> 00:00:51,023
Start with the reason.

15
00:00:51,023 --> 00:00:57,489
Market uncertainty, a cash need, a changing goal, or simply not being sure.

16
00:00:57,489 --> 00:01:01,516
Skip Check does not assume it knows what is right for you.

17
00:01:01,516 --> 00:01:07,093
Enter your current contribution, the change you are considering, and a time period.

18
00:01:07,093 --> 00:01:17,429
Here, reducing twelve thousand rupees a month to six thousand, for six months, means thirty-six thousand rupees less in planned contributions over that period.

19
00:01:17,429 --> 00:01:21,203
That is a comparison of future contributions.

20
00:01:21,203 --> 00:01:23,763
Not a prediction of returns.

21
00:01:23,763 --> 00:01:25,518
Not a loss.

22
00:01:25,518 --> 00:01:30,554
Your existing units stay invested when future contributions pause.

23
00:01:30,554 --> 00:01:33,126
Future units are unknown.

24
00:01:33,126 --> 00:01:36,131
And Skip Check never changes your SIP.

25
00:01:36,131 --> 00:01:39,016
Keep, reduce, or pause.

26
00:01:39,016 --> 00:01:41,348
The choice remains yours.

27
00:01:41,348 --> 00:01:44,172
If you need to pause, you can.

28
00:01:44,172 --> 00:01:49,364
Skip Check will not restart the SIP, and it will not make the change for you.

29
00:01:49,364 --> 00:01:51,612
Understand the difference.

30
00:01:51,612 --> 00:01:54,929
Then finish your decision in your own app.

31
00:01:54,929 --> 00:01:57,802
Skip Check by FinLit Ventures.

32
00:01:57,802 --> 00:01:59,665
See the difference.

33
00:01:59,665 --> 00:02:01,636
Make your decision.

